WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.684
This slide focuses on Select columns and filter rows
Start with the data structure

00:00:05.697 --> 00:00:12.266
and what the operation is supposed to accomplish
before looking closely at the syntax Pandas

00:00:12.292 --> 00:00:17.624
uses column names and conditions to select the part
of the table you need Select

00:00:17.637 --> 00:00:23.610
and filter Before running the example predict the
structure and output

00:00:24.547 --> 00:00:29.705
Run it in the browser inspect the values dimensions
labels or summary then change one

00:00:29.718 --> 00:00:34.863
input and run it again Focus on how the operation
changes the data rather than

00:00:34.889 --> 00:00:36.403
reading the code line by line
